# Experiment runs
# Run folders: commit the small text files (a full record of every run),
# keep weights and plots local (large or re-creatable).
runs/*/*
!runs/*/summary.json
!runs/*/config.yaml
!runs/*/log.csv
!runs/*/sample.txt
!runs/*/git_commit.txt
!runs/*/loss_by_position.csv

